<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.2 </span>Dataset Characteristics</h3>

<div id="A5.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">AIME (American Invitational Mathematics Examination)</span>:</p>
