<div id="A5.I4.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.I4.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Domains: Physics, Chemistry, Biology</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A5.I4.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A5.I4.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.I4.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Format: Multiple choice (A-D)</p>
</div></li>
