<p id="A5.I4.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Validation: PhD-expert verified for difficulty and correctness</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A5.I4.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A5.I4.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.I4.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Reasoning type: Scientific analysis, quantitative reasoning</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A5.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.3 </span>Entropy Calculation Protocol</h3>

<div id="A5.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Logprob Extraction</span>:</p>
<ol id="A5.I5" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="A5.I5.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">1.</span> 
<div id="A5.I5.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.I5.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Extract top-20 token logprobs from model response</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A5.I5.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">2.</span> 
<div id="A5.I5.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.I5.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Apply softmax normalization: <math id="A5.I5.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{i}=\frac{e^{\text{logprob}_{i}}}{\sum_{j=1}^{20}e^{\text{logprob}_{j}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><msub><mtext>logprob</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></msup><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="false"><msubsup><mo maxsize="0.700em" minsize="0.700em" stretchy="true">∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>20</mn></msubsup></mstyle><msup><mi>e</mi><msub><mtext>logprob</mtext><mi>j</mi></msub></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{i}=\frac{e^{\text{logprob}_{i}}}{\sum_{j=1}^{20}e^{\text{logprob}_{j}}}</annotation></semantics></math></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A5.I5.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">3.</span> 
<div id="A5.I5.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.I5.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Compute Shannon entropy per token: <math id="A5.I5.i3.p1.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="H_{t}=-\sum_{i=1}^{20}p_{i}\log_{2}p_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo rspace="0em">=</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.055em">−</mo><mo>∑</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>20</mn></msup><mi>p</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><mi>log</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>p</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H_{t}=-\sum_{i=1}^{20}p_{i}\log_{2}p_{i}</annotation></semantics></math></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A5.I5.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">4.</span> 
<div id="A5.I5.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.I5.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Average across completion tokens: <math id="A5.I5.i4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H_{\text{mean}}=\frac{1}{T}\sum_{t=1}^{T}H_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mtext>mean</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>T</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H_{\text{mean}}=\frac{1}{T}\sum_{t=1}^{T}H_{t}</annotation></semantics></math></p>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div>
<div id="A5.SS3.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.SS3.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS3.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Rationale for top-20</span>:</p>
<ul id="A5.I6" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A5.I6.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A5.I6.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.I6.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Captures majority of probability mass (typically <math id="A5.I6.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&gt;95\%" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&gt;</mo><mrow><mn>95</mn><mo>%</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&gt;95\%</annotation></semantics></math>)</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A5.I6.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A5.I6.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.I6.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Reduces noise from extremely low-probability tokens</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A5.I6.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A5.I6.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.I6.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Computationally efficient for real-time deployment</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A5.I6.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A5.I6.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.I6.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Consistent across model architectures</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A6" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix F </span>Additional Experimental Results</h2>

<section id="A6.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">F.1 </span>Top-k Logprobs Detailed Analysis</h3>

<figure id="A6.F7" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<figure id="A6.F7.sf1" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><img src="2510.08146v1/figures/cohens_d_effect_size.png" id="A6.F7.sf1.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:548/401;" width="548" height="401" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">(a) </span>Cohen’s d effect sizes increase monotonically with k, from 0.574 (k=5) to 0.600 (k=20), indicating stronger discriminative power at higher k values.</figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<figure id="A6.F7.sf2" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><img src="2510.08146v1/figures/accuracy_comparison_legend_high.png" id="A6.F7.sf2.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:548/326;" width="548" height="326" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">(b) </span>Accuracy metrics across k values: Early stop accuracy maintains  79.7-80% while continued questions show  40.7-41.1% accuracy, demonstrating effective uncertainty discrimination.</figcaption>
</figure></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 7: </span>Top-k Logprobs Analysis: Effect Sizes and Accuracy Breakdown</figcaption>
</figure>
<div id="A6.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This detailed analysis complements the main results by showing that higher k values provide incrementally better discriminative power while maintaining consistent accuracy patterns across all tested configurations.</p>
</div>
<div id="A6.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.SS1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Additional Key Findings from the Analysis</span>:</p>
<ul id="A6.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A6.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A6.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Accuracy Preservation</span>: Early stopping accuracy maintains 79.7-80.0% across all k values while continued questions show 40.7-41.1% accuracy, confirming effective confidence discrimination</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A6.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A6.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A6.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Optimal k Selection</span>: k=20 provides the strongest discriminative power (Cohen’s d=0.600) while maintaining computational efficiency, justifying our choice for the main experiments</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A6.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">F.2 </span>Few-Shot Calibration Analysis</h3>

<div id="A6.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.SS2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Calibration requirements</span>:</p>
<ul id="A6.I2" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A6.I2.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A6.I2.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Entropy Mean: 5-10 examples (sufficient for mean estimation).</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A6.I2.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A6.I2.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.I2.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Information-Theoretic: 15-20 examples (effect size calculation).</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A6.I2.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A6.I2.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A6.I2.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Bayesian &amp; Universal: 25+ examples (distribution parameter estimation).</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
<div id="A6.SS2.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.SS2.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.SS2.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Convergence metrics</span>:</p>
<ul id="A6.I3" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A6.I3.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A6.I3.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.I3.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Threshold stability: <math id="A6.I3.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&lt;5\%" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>%</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&lt;5\%</annotation></semantics></math> variation after minimum samples.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A6.I3.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A6.I3.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.I3.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Performance consistency: <math id="A6.I3.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&lt;2\%" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>%</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&lt;2\%</annotation></semantics></math> accuracy variation.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A6.I3.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A6.I3.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A6.I3.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Statistical significance: Maintained across sample sizes.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A6.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">F.3 </span>Production Deployment Algorithm</h3>

<div id="A6.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Algorithm <a href="#alg2" title="Algorithm 2 ‣ F.3 Production Deployment Algorithm ‣ Appendix F Additional Experimental Results ‣ Think Just Enough: Sequence-Level Entropy as a Confidence Signal for LLM Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> describes the complete few-shot framework deployment process for production systems:</p>
</div>
<figure id="alg2" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 2</span> </span> Few-Shot Production Deployment Framework</figcaption>
<div id="alg2.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg2.l0" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">0:</span>
              
              
             Domain questions <math id="alg2.l0.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q=\{q_{1},q_{2},\ldots,q_{n}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q=\{q_{1},q_{2},\ldots,q_{n}\}</annotation></semantics></math>, Model <math id="alg2.l0.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>M</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M</annotation></semantics></math>, Method choice <math id="alg2.l0.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{T}\in\{\text{Info-Theoretic},\text{Bayesian},\text{Universal},\text{Mean}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mtext>Info-Theoretic</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext>Bayesian</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext>Universal</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext>Mean</mtext></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{T}\in\{\text{Info-Theoretic},\text{Bayesian},\text{Universal},\text{Mean}\}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l0a" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">0:</span>
              
              
             Calibrated threshold <math id="alg2.l0a.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau^{*}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>τ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau^{*}</annotation></semantics></math>, Production-ready system

</div>
<div id="alg2.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">1:</span>
              
              
             <span id="alg2.l1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Phase 1: Few-Shot Calibration</span>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">2:</span>
              
              
             Sample <math id="alg2.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>K</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K</annotation></semantics></math> representative questions from target domain (<math id="alg2.l2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K\geq 5" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K\geq 5</annotation></semantics></math> for Mean, <math id="alg2.l2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K\geq 15" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K\geq 15</annotation></semantics></math> for Info-Theoretic, <math id="alg2.l2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K\geq 25" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K\geq 25</annotation></semantics></math> for Bayesian/Universal)

</div>
<div id="alg2.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">3:</span>
              
              
             <span id="alg2.l3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <math id="alg2.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i=1</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="alg2.l3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>K</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>



</div>
<div id="alg2.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">4:</span>
              
              
              <math id="alg2.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r_{i}\leftarrow M(q_{i})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r_{i}\leftarrow M(q_{i})</annotation></semantics></math> {Generate response with logprobs}

</div>
<div id="alg2.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">5:</span>
              
              
              <math id="alg2.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H_{i}\leftarrow\text{ComputeEntropy}(r_{i})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>ComputeEntropy</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H_{i}\leftarrow\text{ComputeEntropy}(r_{i})</annotation></semantics></math> {Calculate Shannon entropy}

</div>
<div id="alg2.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">6:</span>
              
              
              <math id="alg2.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c_{i}\leftarrow\text{VerifyCorrectness}(r_{i},q_{i})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>VerifyCorrectness</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c_{i}\leftarrow\text{VerifyCorrectness}(r_{i},q_{i})</annotation></semantics></math> {Human verification}

</div>
<div id="alg2.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">7:</span>
              
              
             <span id="alg2.l7.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg2.l7.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">8:</span>
              
              
             Partition: <math id="alg2.l8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{C}=\{H_{i}:c_{i}=\text{correct}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>correct</mtext></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{C}=\{H_{i}:c_{i}=\text{correct}\}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="alg2.l8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{I}=\{H_{i}:c_{i}=\text{incorrect}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>incorrect</mtext></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{I}=\{H_{i}:c_{i}=\text{incorrect}\}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">9:</span>
              
              
             Compute statistics: <math id="alg2.l9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mu_{c},\sigma_{c},\mu_{i},\sigma_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mu_{c},\sigma_{c},\mu_{i},\sigma_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">10:</span>
              
              
             <math id="alg2.l10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau^{*}\leftarrow\text{ComputeThreshold}(\mu_{c},\sigma_{c},\mu_{i},\sigma_{i},\mathcal{T})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>τ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>ComputeThreshold</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau^{*}\leftarrow\text{ComputeThreshold}(\mu_{c},\sigma_{c},\mu_{i},\sigma_{i},\mathcal{T})</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">11:</span>
              
              
             <span id="alg2.l11.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Phase 2: Production Deployment</span>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">12:</span>
              
              
             <span id="alg2.l12.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">while</span> new production question <math id="alg2.l12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>q</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l12.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>



</div>
<div id="alg2.l13" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">13:</span>
              
              
              <math id="alg2.l13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r\leftarrow M(q)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r\leftarrow M(q)</annotation></semantics></math> {Generate first reasoning step}

</div>
<div id="alg2.l14" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">14:</span>
              
              
              <math id="alg2.l14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H\leftarrow\text{ComputeEntropy}(r)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>ComputeEntropy</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H\leftarrow\text{ComputeEntropy}(r)</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l15" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">15:</span>
              
              
              <span id="alg2.l15.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <math id="alg2.l15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H\leq\tau^{*}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>≤</mo><msup><mi>τ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H\leq\tau^{*}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l15.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>



</div>
<div id="alg2.l16" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">16:</span>
              
              
               Return <math id="alg2.l16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>r</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r</annotation></semantics></math> {High confidence - early stop}

</div>
<div id="alg2.l17" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">17:</span>
              
              
               <math id="alg2.l17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{cost\_saved}\leftarrow\text{API\_calls\_saved}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext>cost_saved</mtext><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mtext>API_calls_saved</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{cost\_saved}\leftarrow\text{API\_calls\_saved}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l18" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">18:</span>
              
              
              <span id="alg2.l18.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">else</span>


</div>
<div id="alg2.l19" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">19:</span>
              
              
               Continue full reasoning chain

</div>
<div id="alg2.l20" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">20:</span>
              
              
               Return complete response

</div>
<div id="alg2.l21" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">21:</span>
              
              
              <span id="alg2.l21.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg2.l21.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l22" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">22:</span>
              
              
             <span id="alg2.l22.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg2.l22.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">while</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l23" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">23:</span>
              
              
             <span id="alg2.l23.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Phase 3: Continuous Monitoring</span>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l24" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">24:</span>
              
              
             Periodically re-calibrate <math id="alg2.l24.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau^{*}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>τ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau^{*}</annotation></semantics></math> with new domain examples

</div>
<div id="alg2.l25" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">25:</span>
              
              
             Monitor accuracy and cost savings metrics

</div>
<div id="alg2.l26" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">26:</span>
              
              
             Adjust threshold if performance degrades below targets

</div>
</div>
</figure>
</section>
</section>
